    "detailed_description": "In a fantastic universe, form a group of up to 5 dwarves.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose a class then set off on an adventure in mines and galleries. Your goal is to extract materials there. However one of you finds yourself infected, and becomes a creature whose goal is to prevent his former colleagues from leaving again... Survive by working as a team but also by using your environment, your equipment and your skills to escape and trick your worst nightmare.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFrom the monster's point of view, move on the walls and ceilings. Use your skills to set traps, locate them, hide or hit your targets.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you be the hunter or the prey?",
    "about_the_game": "In a fantastic universe, form a group of up to 5 dwarves.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose a class then set off on an adventure in mines and galleries. Your goal is to extract materials there. However one of you finds yourself infected, and becomes a creature whose goal is to prevent his former colleagues from leaving again... Survive by working as a team but also by using your environment, your equipment and your skills to escape and trick your worst nightmare.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFrom the monster's point of view, move on the walls and ceilings. Use your skills to set traps, locate them, hide or hit your targets.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you be the hunter or the prey?",
